  "source_note": "<!-- zh -->\n漫画分镜。排版：时钟式，面板围绕钟表、圆盘或时间刻度组织，适合一天或倒计时主题。让该分镜机制决定页面结构、阅读顺序、主次画格和镜头节奏；输出一张完整单页漫画页面，画格共同讲述连续情节，角色外观在各格保持一致。\n\n<!-- en -->\nComic storyboard. Layout: Clock Face Radial Layout, panels organized around circular clock face or timeline dial, ideal for 24-hour cycle or countdown motif. Let this storyboard mechanism determine the page structure, reading flow, panel hierarchy, and pacing; output a complete single-page comic where panels tell a continuous story with consistent characters.\n",
